@saksham1341 Also added GLM-4.7 to my config:

```json
"opencode/glm-4.7-free": {
  "token_threshold": 138000,
  "context_threshold": 0.50
}
```

This compacts at 138k tokens (~50% of the model's likely context window of 128k+). Perfect for coding sessions with GLM.

try this OpenCode config

```json
{
    "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
    "lsp": {
        "php intelephense": {
            "disabled": true
        },
        "intelephense": {
            "command": [
                "intelephense",
                "--stdio"
            ],
            "extensions": [".php"],
            "initialization": {
                "environment": {
                    "documentRoot": "/absolute/path/to/your/wordpress"
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```
